    // and the last one departs not later than 11:59 PM (23*60+59 = 1439 minutes)
    // Actually, the problem says "the first one is at 05:00 AM and the last one departs not later than at 11:59 PM"
    // This applies to both directions.

    // We need to count buses from B that Simion meets on the way.
