    // Finish: at city B at time simionArrive. A bus from B would be at B at time t.
    //   If t == simionArrive, they meet at B. Exclude.

    // So the condition is:
    //   simionDepart - tb < t < simionArrive
    //   AND t != simionDepart - tb (which is the same as t + tb != simionDepart)
    //   AND t != simionArrive

