    // The bus departs at time d, arrives at d + tb
    // They meet if:
    //   d < simionArrival (bus departs before Simion arrives at B)
    //   d + tb > simionDeparture (bus arrives at A after Simion departs)
    // But we should NOT count encounters at start and finish.
    // Encounter at start: bus arrives at A exactly when Simion departs (d + tb == simionDeparture)
    // Encounter at finish: bus departs from B exactly when Simion arrives at B (d == simionArrival)

