    // The condition "d + tb > simionDeparture" already excludes d + tb == simionDeparture

    // So we just need: d < simionArrival AND d + tb > simionDeparture

    // Buses from B depart at times: 300, 300+b, 300+2b, ... up to 23*60+59 = 1439
    // But also, buses can depart before 05:00? No, the first bus is at 05:00.
    // Wait, the problem says "the first one is at 05:00 AM and the last one departs not later than at 11:59 PM"
    // So buses from B depart at 300, 300+b, 300+2b, ... where departure time <= 1439

